#. type: Plain text
#: fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These special time specification \"nicknames\" which replace the 5 initial "
"time and date fields, and are prefixed with the '@' character, are supported:"
msgstr ""

